msgstr "%d Izinhlamvu"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Slowlog Table Names [ optional ]"
msgstr "Amagama Amathebula e-Slowlog [ uyazikhethela ]"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Leave Blank for Auto Detection which runs must faster."
msgstr "Shiya Kungenalutho ukuze kutholakale ngokuzenzakalelayo okusebenza ngokushesha okukhulu."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Ukutholwa Kwamathebula e-Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Indlela yokuhlukanisa amathebula ase-Cacti kwamanye amathebula okubhekiselwe kuwo kwilogi yemibuzo ehamba kancane. Ngokuzenzakalelayo ithola wonke amathebula ngaphandle kokuwaqoqa."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Thola wonke amathebula (akukho ukuqoqa kwe-'OTHER TABLES')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Sebenzisa lesi Sizindalwazi se-Cacti; qoqa amanye amathebula njenge-'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Thola wonke amathebula; qoqa amathebula angekho ohlwini olungezansi njenge-'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Amathebula Abalulekile"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Isetshenziswa kuphela inketho ethi 'Thola wonke amathebula; qoqa ... njenge-OTHER TABLES' ngenhla. Sicela unikeze uhlu oluhlukaniswe ngesikhala lwamathebula aziwayo okuzoqhathaniswa nawo. Ku-Linux/UNIX, ungathola uhlu lwamathebula ngokusebenzisa lo myalo olandelayo:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>umsebenzisi</b></i> -p<i><b>iphasiwedi</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>isizindalwazi</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Amanani athi '<i><b>umsebenzisi</b></i>', '<i><b>iphasiwedi</b></i>', kanye nethi '<i><b>isizindalwazi</b></i>' athathwa ngamanani akho."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Imikhawulo Yokulayisha"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Imikhawulo yosayizi wefayela yokulayisha ku-Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Usayizi Omkhulu Wefayela Elilayishwayo"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Usayizi omkhulu wefayela iseva yakho ye-Apache ezovumela ukuthi lilayishwe usethwe kunani elingakwesokudla. Okwamanje, awukwazi ukulayisha ifayela elikhulu kunaleli. Uma unamalogi ahamba kancane e-MySQL amakhulu kunalokhu, kufanele uguqule ifayela le-<i>php.ini</i> elihlobene ne-Apache, uthole okuguquguqukayo okuthi <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> bese wenyusa inani. Ngemva kwalokho kufanele uqale kabusha i-Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Usayizi Omkhulu We-Post"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Usayizi omkhulu ongawuthumela kuseva ye-Apache usethwe kunani elingakwesokudla. Uma unamalogi ahamba kancane e-MySQL amakhulu kunaleli nani, kufanele uguqule ifayela le-<i>php.ini</i> elihlobene ne-Apache, uthole okuguquguqukayo okuthi <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> bese wenyusa inani lalo. Ngemva kwalokho kufanele uqale kabusha i-Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Isikhathi Esikhulu Sokusebenza"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Isikhathi (ngemizuzwana) lesi sicelo esivunyelwe ukusebenza ngaso; u-0 usho ukuthi akunamkhawulo. Le plugin isivele ikukhuphulela kokungenamkhawulo ezicelweni zayo, kodwa iseva yewebhu noma i-reverse proxy ephambi kwe-PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) isengasinqamula isicelo ngokuzimele - lokho ngeke kutholakale noma kushaywe indiva kusuka lapha."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Okungenamkhawulo"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Umkhawulo Wenkumbulo"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Ingakanani inkumbulo lesi sicelo esivunyelwe ukuyisebenzisa; u--1 usho ukuthi akunamkhawulo. Le plugin isivele ikukhuphulela kokungenamkhawulo ezicelweni zayo. Ilogi enkulu kakhulu yemibuzo ehamba kancane efundwa/engeniswa esicelweni esisodwa ingeqa inani elinomkhawulo."

